{"id":"n91680-1-9","stage":5,"title":"지구촌 · 地球村","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91680-1-9-1","ko":"전 세계 곳곳을 하루면 다 갈 수 있다니 참 세상 좋아졌구나.","zh":"一天就能到达世界各地，世界真是方便多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"전","meaning":"全","explanation":"전：全","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70827","senseId":"1","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}},{"text":"세계","meaning":"世界","explanation":"세계：世界","readings":[{"term":"세계","audio":"/audio/28403a52feffec214da2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62444","senseId":"1","lemma":"세계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세계","audio":"/audio/28403a52feffec214da2.mp3"}},{"text":"곳곳을","meaning":"到处，各地，处处，各处","explanation":"곳곳：到处，各地，处处，各处；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"곳곳","audio":"/audio/a6cae037c9233c8a18e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18669","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곳곳을","audio":"/audio/c28f8140b3489780f691.mp3"}},{"text":"하루면","meaning":"一天","explanation":"하루：一天；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"하루","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49315","senseId":"1","lemma":"하루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하루면","audio":"/audio/a919bbe1b09d5b68153c.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"갈","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈","audio":"/audio/eb4ba4907fe859283419.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있다니","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；다니：对得知的内容表示惊讶、感叹，并连接后文。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있다니","audio":"/audio/44998a526bbdbde1d17c.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"세상","meaning":"世上，世间","explanation":"세상：世上，世间","readings":[{"term":"세상","audio":"/audio/412ee72fe0ab7746e409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62441","senseId":"2","lemma":"세상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세상","audio":"/audio/412ee72fe0ab7746e409.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아졌구나.","meaning":"方便，好；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"좋다：方便，好；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"13","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아졌구나","audio":"/audio/f45f3b561f1722e2839d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d9f427c3257e81e0","term":"전","zh":"全","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3","entryId":"70827","definition":"所有的，整体的。","pronunciation":["전"]},{"id":"28403a52feffec21","term":"세계","zh":"世界","audio":"/audio/28403a52feffec214da2.mp3","entryId":"62444","definition":"地球上的所有国家。","pronunciation":["세ː계","세ː게"]},{"id":"a6cae037c9233c8a","term":"곳곳","zh":"到处，各地，处处，各处","audio":"/audio/a6cae037c9233c8a18e3.mp3","entryId":"18669","definition":"好几个地方；或指各个地方。","pronunciation":["곧꼳"]},{"id":"621a158068fae5de","term":"하루","zh":"一天","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3","entryId":"49315","definition":"从晚上12点到第二天晚上12点的24个小时。","pronunciation":["하루"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"412ee72fe0ab7746","term":"세상","zh":"世上，世间","audio":"/audio/412ee72fe0ab7746e409.mp3","entryId":"62441","definition":"人生活的整个社会。","pronunciation":["세ː상"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"方便，好","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某事做起来很容易或很便利。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a2a5c6aa83e80141ef6b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n91680-1-9-2","ko":"이젠 지구촌 시대니까요.","zh":"现在是地球村时代了嘛。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이젠","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이젠","audio":"/audio/608fbeb8dab2dde62121.mp3"}},{"text":"지구촌","meaning":"地球村","explanation":"지구촌：地球村","readings":[{"term":"지구촌","audio":"/audio/eb434ee4650fc11e8483.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91680","senseId":"1","lemma":"지구촌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지구촌","audio":"/audio/eb434ee4650fc11e8483.mp3"}},{"text":"시대니까요.","meaning":"时期，时代","explanation":"시대：时期，时代；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니까요：在句末礼貌地解释原因或依据。","readings":[{"term":"시대","audio":"/audio/0ba34ab95fbb912ac3c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65119","senseId":"1","lemma":"시대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시대니까요","audio":"/audio/22fbc6404bc567019509.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"当下的时期。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"eb434ee4650fc11e","term":"지구촌","zh":"地球村","audio":"/audio/eb434ee4650fc11e8483.mp3","entryId":"91680","definition":"用于指称整个地球，把地球比喻为一个村庄。","pronunciation":["지구촌"]},{"id":"0ba34ab95fbb912a","term":"시대","zh":"时期，时代","audio":"/audio/0ba34ab95fbb912ac3c7.mp3","entryId":"65119","definition":"历史上以某个特征为基准划分的一定时期。","pronunciation":["시대"]}],"audio":"/audio/468dcab42480b3aa61e3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.347,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=91680","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":159,"sequenceScore":3.1737,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["现在是地球村时代了嘛。","一天就能到达世界各地，世界真是方便多了。","你怀里抱着什么，一直在轻轻抚摸？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["一天就能到达世界各地，世界真是方便多了。","你怀里抱着什么，一直在轻轻抚摸？